Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:09.36,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 蒙特利尔 ATP1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:09.36,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}商竣程 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs38}7-5 4-6 7-6(5){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 卢布列夫 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Jerry congratulations after you came
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰瑞 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.86,EN,,0,0,0,,over to the bench. You just dropped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,刚才你回到座位那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:07.70,EN,,0,0,0,,your head and kind of stared at the court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,低着头 盯着球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:09.40,EN,,0,0,0,,for a little while. What's going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,看了好一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.86,EN,,0,0,0,,through your mind after two hours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,打完这两小时 45 分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:13.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and 45 minutes of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,你脑子里在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:15.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I think first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 首先我想说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Andrey is a great friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,安德烈是很好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.48,EN,,0,0,0,,He's a great competitor, a good champion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,他是很强的对手 也是位好冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:20.74,EN,,0,0,0,,on the courts, and it's a pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:20.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在球场上再一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:22.14,EN,,0,0,0,,to share the court with him again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:22.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟他同场 是件愉快的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.16,EN,,0,0,0,,since since last time we played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,上一次 上一次我们交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:24.68,EN,,0,0,0,,in Hong Kong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是在香港
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:26.90,EN,,0,0,0,,but more happily, I'm healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,但更让我高兴的是 我健康了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.90,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm 100% playing my best tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,我百分百打出了最好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and just really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,也真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.94,EN,,0,0,0,,to be in Montreal playing healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,能来到蒙特利尔 身体健康
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:33.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and playing happy again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,重新打得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.34,EN,,0,0,0,,What does a win like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:37.86,EN,,0,0,0,,that do for you do for your confidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你意味着什么 对信心呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,And what does it tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,它又能告诉你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:41.28,EN,,0,0,0,,about what your level is right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,关于你现在处在什么水平？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:44.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I think I know the tennis is there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道 我的网球还在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.68,EN,,0,0,0,,but I just have to have to get it out of me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是得 得把它从身体里打出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:48.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and stay healthy. But again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,还要保持健康 不过话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:49.92,EN,,0,0,0,,that's the that's the biggest part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是 这就是最关键的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,about being a top player. Andrey, Andrey, he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,想成为顶尖球员 安德烈 安德烈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:54.74,EN,,0,0,0,,has that and he's competing all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:54.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,他做到了 而且他全年都在打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So that's something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that I have to learn from the top players
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我得向顶尖球员学的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to get my level back. Just again super happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,好把状态找回来 再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to be healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很高兴自己健康
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.50,EN,,0,0,0,,That's the number one priority
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是第一位的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:04.94,EN,,0,0,0,,and if I can win some matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果还能赢下几场球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:06.02,EN,,0,0,0,,that'll be amazing too
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,那就再好不过了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:06.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:06.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:07.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
